ds require retained pore-water or pool inventories rather than unrestricted ocean dilution. Acid hydrolysis streams must be cooled and neutralized before mixing with iron-containing streams; cyanide-containing streams must not be acidified until free cyanide has been removed or independently accounted for. Neutral acid formulas are reference states for reaction bookkeeping; actual protonation and metal complexation depend on pH. Balanced reference equations and coefficients are stated in mechanisms without duplicating molecule IDs.\n\nMOLECULES (35 nodes):\n  - mol_001: C5H6O5 (2-oxoglutaric acid) [starting]\n  - mol_002: NH3 (ammonia) [starting]\n  - mol_003: NH3O (hydroxylamine) [starting]\n  - mol_004: H2 (hydrogen) [starting]\n  - mol_005: Fe (native iron) [starting]\n  - mol_006: H+ (proton) [starting]\n  - mol_007: H2O (water) [starting]\n  - mol_008: Fe+2 (ferrous ion) [starting]\n  - mol_009: C5H7NO4 (2-oxoglutarate imine) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_010: C5H7NO5 (2-oxoglutarate oxime) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_011: C5H9NO4 (DL-glutamic acid) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_012: C5H8NO4- (DL-glutamate) [target]\n  - mol_013: CH2O (formaldehyde) [starting]\n  - mol_014: CHN (hydrogen cyanide) [starting]\n  - mol_015: C2H4N2 (aminoacetonitrile) [intermediate]\n  - mol_016: C2H6N2O (glycinamide) [intermediate]\n  - mol_017: C2H5NO2 (glycine) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_018: C2H2O3 (glyoxylic acid) [starting]\n  - mol_019: C2H4O (acetaldehyde) [starting]\n  - mol_020: C3H6N2 (alanine nitrile) [intermediate]\n  - mol_021: C3H8N2O (alaninamide) [intermediate]\n  - mol_022: C3H7NO2 (DL-alanine) [hub_intermediate]\n  - mol_023: C3H4O3 (pyruvic acid) [starting]\n  - mol_024: C4H4O5 (oxaloacetic acid) [starting]\n  - mol_025: C4H5NO5 (oxaloacetate oxime) [intermediate]\n  - mol_026: C4H7NO4 (DL-aspartic acid) [intermediate]\n  - mol_027: C4H6O3 (succinic semialdehyde) [starting]\n  - mol_028: C5H8N2O2 (glutamic acid alpha-aminonitrile) [intermediate]\n  - mol_029: C5H10